/- English proof (translation)
Introduce `hP F E _ _ _ _ _ σ Bs a a' G Xc om om' R Rf hM γ hγ Φ Φ₁ hΦ hd`. Take `⟨T, hT, m, f, φ, hf, rfl, hz⟩` from `hΦ`. Establish `act` using `_root_.GlobalTheory.T.dualPair_preserves_polarization hP _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ (GlobalTheory.ThK.RealUniq.isPair_V hM.triple)`. Take `⟨D, hDm, hDi⟩` from `act.2.2.1 γ hγ`. Establish `hstd : ∀ i, ∀ᶠ v in Filter.cofinite, φ i v = Set.indicator {x | ∀ j, x j ∈ v.adicCompletionIntegers F} 1`.

